-
-<h2>Rules 3 and 4</h2>
-
-<p>
-        This section does not test the behavior of columns, column groups,
-        or captions.
-</p>
-
-<div>
-<span class="tableRow">
-<span class="tableCell">Table 1, Row 1, Cell 1</span>
